world.\n* Living Room experience: full passthrough, dig and build the reality around you.\n* VR World: enter in a full virtual infinite world and create limitlessy.\n* ZombieLand: enter in a full virtual infinite world populated with hungry zombies.", "short_description": "Unleash you creativity with the most complete blocks experience for your Oculus Meta Quest.\nBuild, like never before, your own world blended with the reality with the stunning passthrough mode, feel free to create your own universe with the full VR creative mode, fight ordes of blocky zombies with the survival mode."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.blockversexr.com/p/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Running Pixel", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.blockversexr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "1725996564472128"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "EXPLORATION", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1609474952755444"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1011294733156003"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1011294733156003"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1649149200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1011294733156003"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28845015925189934", "version": "1.5.10"}, "id": "335885658336562", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4561040437347488", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28845015925189934"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "335885658336562"}]}, "change_log": "- added Quest 2 support (with limited feature)\r\n- added 90hz support!\r\n- better and faster graphics\r\n- apk size reduced by 30%\r\n- bug fix and optimizations", "created_date": 1793379931, "id": "28845015925189934", "version": "1.5.10", "version_code": 1764, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4561040437347488", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28845015925189934"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "335885658336562"}]}, "change_log": "- better overall performances\r\n- small bug fix", "created_date": 1792584368, "id": "28717811627910365", "version": "1.5.02", "version_code": 1732, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4561040437347488", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28845015925189934"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "335885658336562"}]}, "change_log": "# BlockVerse 1.5.01 \u2014 Release Notes\n\nFixes from last build:\n-Bug fix in some first time Room Scanning\n-Easier to use Hands Tracking AI building tool\n\nDiscover your room from a whole new perspective, turn ideas into voxel creations, and enjoy smoother building and exploration.\n\n- **DollHouse Mode:** Explore and build inside a miniature voxel version of your real room, where everyday furniture becomes towering scenery.\n- **Fly mode:** Take to the air in immersive DollHouse Mode using controllers or hand tracking, and explore your creations from above.\n- **AI Builder:** Describe what you want by voice or text, inspect the voxel preview, and confirm to add it to your world.\n- **Smarter room scanning:** Improved capture of walls, floors, sloped ceilings, furniture, and props, with AI-assisted object recognition, better textures, and more reliable saved-room loading.\n- **More creative tools:** Added alphabet blocks, the Super Shovel, and selective digging, alongside improvements to connected blocks. Doors now open when you bump into them.\n- **Better hands-free play:** Restored pinch-to-build and pinch-to-dig, refined block/tool palettes, updated control guides, and fixed torch and held-tool issues when switching to hand tracking.\n- **Performance and gameplay fixes:** Faster startup and loading, smoother scanned-world saving, improved teleportation and spawn positions, and fixes for falling through floors and passing through blocks.", "created_date": 1792324810, "id": "28677083005316561", "version": "1.5.01", "version_code": 1721, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4561040437347488", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28845015925189934"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "335885658336562"}]}, "change_log": "# BlockVerse 1.5.01 \u2014 Release Notes\r\n\r\nDiscover your room from a whole new perspective, turn ideas into voxel creations, and enjoy smoother building and exploration.\r\n\r\n- **DollHouse Mode:** Explore and build inside a miniature voxel version of your real room, where everyday furniture becomes towering scenery.\r\n- **Fly mode:** Take to the air in immersive DollHouse Mode using controllers or hand tracking, and explore your creations from above.\r\n- **AI Builder:** Describe what you want by voice or text, inspect the voxel preview, and confirm to add it to your world.\r\n- **Smarter room scanning:** Improved capture of walls, floors, sloped ceilings, furniture, and props, with AI-assisted object recognition, better textures, and more reliable saved-room loading.\r\n- **More creative tools:** Added alphabet blocks, the Super Shovel, and selective digging, alongside improvements to connected blocks. Doors now open when you bump into them.\r\n- **Better hands-free play:** Restored pinch-to-build and pinch-to-dig, refined block/tool palettes, updated control guides, and fixed torch and held-tool issues when switching to hand tracking.\r\n- **Performance and gameplay fixes:** Faster startup and loading, smoother scanned-world saving, improved teleportation and spawn positions, and fixes for falling through floors and passing through blocks.", "created_date": 1791925338, "id": "28612616621763200", "version": "1.5.01", "version_code": 1718, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4561040437347488", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28845015925189934"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "335885658336562"}]}, "change_log": "# BlockVerse 1.5.01 \u2014 Release Notes\n\nDiscover your room from a whole new perspective, turn ideas into voxel creations, and enjoy smoother building and exploration.\n\n- **DollHouse Mode:** Explore and build inside a miniature voxel version of your real room, where everyday furniture becomes towering scenery.\n- **Fly mode:** Take to the air in immersive DollHouse Mode using controllers or hand tracking, and explore your creations from above.\n- **AI Builder:** Describe what you want by voice or text, inspect the voxel preview, and confirm to add it to your world.\n- **Smarter room scanning:** Improved capture of walls, floors, sloped ceilings, furniture, and props, with AI-assisted object recognition, better textures, and more reliable saved-room loading.\n- **More creative tools:** Added alphabet blocks, the Super Shovel, and selective digging, alongside improvements to connected blocks. Doors now open when you bump into them.\n- **Better hands-free play:** Restored pinch-to-build and pinch-to-dig, refined block/tool palettes, updated control guides, and fixed torch and held-tool issues when switching to hand tracking.\n- **Performance and gameplay fixes:** Faster startup and loading, smoother scanned-world saving, improved teleportation and spawn positions, and fixes for falling through floors and passing through blocks.", "created_date": 1791631754, "id": "28565074909850705", "version": "1.5.01", "version_code": 1717, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}